WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.650
Guile begins the first raw Drive Rush toward standing Manon.

2
00:00:00.650 --> 00:00:01.300
Standing medium punch connects.

3
00:00:01.300 --> 00:00:02.150
Down-forward heavy kick follows the Rush medium.

4
00:00:02.150 --> 00:00:03.000
The Overdrive projectile holds Manon in the corner juggle.

5
00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:03.450
Guile uses a second raw Drive Rush after OD Boom.

6
00:00:03.450 --> 00:00:04.100
Standing heavy kick catches the airborne opponent.

7
00:00:04.100 --> 00:00:04.500
Heavy Flash Kick follows the Rush juggle.

8
00:00:04.500 --> 00:00:09.550
Guile cancels the kick into Critical Art.

9
00:00:09.550 --> 00:00:10.300
Manon lands after the Critical Art finish.
